  m_Name: HRQ_12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HRQuizQSO
  _question: Christa summoned a low-level imp to do her spreadsheets. What do you
    do?
  _inverseQuestion: Christa summoned a low-level imp to do her spreadsheets. What
    do you <color=red>not</color> do?
  _answerRight: Banish her imp and remind her that spreadsheets must be examined
    by humans only.
  _answerWrong: Christa has the right idea. I summon a few imps of my own and go
    home early.
